  "title": "Banana Chai Bread",
  "description": "A few splashes of your favorite chai (spiced Indian tea) add a complex spiciness to this banana bread. And non-fat cream cheese adds rich flavor without the guilt.",
  "authors": [
    "Talia"
  ],
